# Keep text files text, whatever Windows does to them.
* text=auto

*.md   text eol=lf
*.txt  text eol=lf
*.csv  text eol=lf
*.py   text eol=lf
*.cff  text eol=lf

# Binary assets that must never be line-ending converted.
*.png  binary
*.jpg  binary
*.jpeg binary

# The 14,418 tiles and masks under data/ are tracked directly, not through Git LFS:
# no file exceeds 20 kB and the whole set is under 100 MB, so a plain clone is enough.
# If you ever re-release masks repeatedly, switch data/ to LFS instead — binary blobs
# do not delta-compress, so every committed edit costs the full file size.